{
  "id": "minimax-h3-triprism-pack",
  "name": "MiniMax H3 (TriPrism)",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "author": "OliviaRossi (merge of Sulphur 3, 10Eros Max and Singularity v2); Zhengming Yu et al. (DMAD), Zimo Wang et al. and Iwannapose (PDMD)",
  "nsfw": false,
  "description": "Model format: int8 ConvRot. Steps: 8 by default.\n\nOliviaRossi's TriPrism, a merge of Sulphur 3, 10Eros Max and Singularity v2 with the DMAD and PDMD distillations and a realism LoRA baked into one 21.1 GB file. Text, image and reference to video from that one file, with no LoRA to load and nothing to install. Downloads from Hugging Face, so no Civitai key is needed. Eight steps by default (euler, simple, shift 12/3, no CFG), the same settings as the PRISM DMAD PDMD cards, since the model card gives none. Over seven seeds against PRISM DMAD PDMD int8 it made the same shots with slightly warmer colour and ran 10 to 20% faster. Works with the app's Faster Attention toggle.",
  "tags": [
    "8-Step",
    "I2V",
    "Local",
    "Merge",
    "MiniMax H3",
    "R2V",
    "T2V",
    "Video"
  ],
