          "notes": "ONE checkpoint serves all three presets (21.1 GB int8 ConvRot, from Hugging Face, no key, revision 73d2019). OliviaRossi's merge of Sulphur 3, 10Eros Max 8-step Turbo (hybrid) and Singularity v2 ref2va, with DMAD 0.85, PDMD 0.333 and the MMH3 Realism slider at 1.5 baked in. The model card gives no settings; these are the PRISM DMAD PDMD int8 cards' (euler/simple, 8 steps, sigma shift 12.0 video / 3.0 audio, no CFG), and only 8 steps was tested. MEASURED 2026-11-24 through the app (RTX 4070 Ti 12 GB, 864x480, 5 s, Faster Attention on, both models warm, same prompts and seeds): text to video 71.7-72.7 s against 89.4-91.3 s for PRISM DMAD PDMD int8, reference 82.1 s against 96.0 s, 768p text to video 216.1 s against 240.3 s; image to video 77.1 s. Over seven seeds the pictures matched PRISM's shot for shot, slightly warmer; scripted lines word for word. Spectrum step-skipping is deliberately NOT enabled: it garbled a spoken line on other distilled H3 checkpoints."
